  "notes": [
   "Domain: 1.07 vehicle lengths of road ahead of the design, 2.70 behind it, and 14.3 m of headroom (11× its height, 8.0 % blockage) under a frictionless ceiling. The belt moves with the free stream, as on a rolling-road wind tunnel.",
